{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34580","headline":"和袭美春夕酒醒 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美春夕酒醒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年无事傍江湖，醉倒黄公旧酒垆。\n觉後不知明月上，满身花影倩人扶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷六二六、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》陆龟蒙条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）"}